Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,Let him talk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:22.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's free discovery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:23.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,She hid her age
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:25.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,He didn't ask
