Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:38.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tell them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:43.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,Inside Gary
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,Brooks versus Ashford
