Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:55.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,rich she took
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:00:56.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,advantage of a young
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:57.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,man in a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:00:58.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,vulnerable state
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.84,0:01:00.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,What vulnerable state?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:00.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vegas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.25,0:01:05.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,March 14th Exhibit A
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:16.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:20.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,The house
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:26.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,Keep the jet warm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.59,0:01:28.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:29.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,Old enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.53,0:01:31.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,that table?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:32.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,Marry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:34.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.21,0:01:36.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Do you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:38.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tyler?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.21,0:01:40.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,I I do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.41,0:01:42.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,I do
