Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:50.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Believe what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:53.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:01:56.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,Her passport
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.07,0:01:57.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,I thought it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:01:58.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,was a typo
