Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:02.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,married her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.93,0:02:04.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,We want half
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.55,0:02:05.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,Half
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:06.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,No prenup
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.33,0:02:09.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nothing further
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:09.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mr Hale?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:10.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,You said you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.39,0:02:10.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,thought she was
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.89,0:02:11.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,in her thirties
