Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:13.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,face every morning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.71,0:02:16.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,Let's look at it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:20.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,Daylight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.05,0:02:21.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,No makeup
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.27,0:02:23.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,Looking down
