Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:40.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,every light
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:41.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,She hid nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.57,0:02:43.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,Exhibit 15
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:45.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,Born June 2nd 1965
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:46.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,She's 61
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:49.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who took exhibit 14?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.49,0:02:51.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Brianna
