Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:05.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mrs Ashford 61
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.43,0:03:07.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,In June
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:09.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,Neck creams
