Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:26.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,my chin out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.49,0:03:27.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,By night it's all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,I can see
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:31.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,You understand why I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.07,0:03:31.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,need to know what
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.53,0:03:32.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,you've done
