Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:51.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:52.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then it sat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:52.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,on top
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.01,0:03:54.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Give me your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:03:59.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:01.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,In
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:02.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.61,0:04:03.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,mine work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:04.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,It sat on top
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.73,0:04:05.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,Most of it ended
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:06.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,up in here
