Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:08.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,it either
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.03,0:04:09.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,First night nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:10.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,on my pillow
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:11.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,How long have you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:12.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,been on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:13.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,Since before Vegas
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:14.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,The bands went soft
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:15.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,in four weeks
