Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:24.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,serum's different?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:25.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,Creams sit on top
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.43,0:04:26.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,This goes in
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:27.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,What does it cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.99,0:04:28.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,Twenty a bottle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:33.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,Five minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:33.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mrs Ashford
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:34.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,What if it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:35.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,doesn't work on
