Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:38.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,refund you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:39.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,What's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:42.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mediskiin. Two I's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:54.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nine years
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.55,0:04:55.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,I thought it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.07,0:04:56.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,was just me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:00.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Back in session
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:03.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Your honor
