Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:07.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,insurance policy on my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:08.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,client taken out nine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:09.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,days after the wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:10.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,Beneficiary Tyler
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:11.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,Brooks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:12.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,Your Honor
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:13.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,this is what we
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:13.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,call a murder-for-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:14.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,profit scheme
