Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:20.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,I did
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:20.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who switched
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.81,0:05:21.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,the glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.07,0:05:22.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,She did
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:24.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Why kill a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:25.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,you thought was 34?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:27.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:28.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,Look at her neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:29.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,There's not a single
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:30.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,line on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:32.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,She's 61 and she's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:33.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,gonna live forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:35.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,So you always knew
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:37.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,You just got
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:38.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,tired of waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:40.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tyler Brooks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:41.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,FBI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:44.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:45.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,for the attempted
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:45.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,murder of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:46.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vivian Ashford
