Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:50.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,But I flipped
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:51.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tell the U.S
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:52.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,Attorney
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:53.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,You were supposed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:54.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,to be old
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:55.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,I am
